// Zellij config — Rai Butera
// Reset to near-OOTB on 2026-07-04 to learn zellij's real default paradigm +
// keybindings for real. Everything not set here uses zellij's built-in defaults
// (default modal keybinds, pane frames, status bar, layouts, etc.) — that is the
// point: the out-of-the-box experience most people have.
//
// Kept (personal / integration touches, not workflow remaps):
//   - theme (catppuccin-mocha)
//   - default shell (zsh)
//   - system clipboard via OSC52 (copy_clipboard "system" + copy_on_select)
//
// Deliberately NOT here (were custom, now default): the cleared-defaults keybind
// set (127 remaps), custom WASM plugins (monocle/forgot/etc.), pane_frames false,
// on_force_close detach, and the other UI overrides. Add things back intentionally
// as you learn what the defaults actually do.
//
// Docs: https://zellij.dev/documentation/

theme "catppuccin-mocha"
default_shell "zsh"

// System clipboard over OSC52 (works over SSH / in tmux-less remote shells).
copy_clipboard "system"
copy_on_select true
